h <strong data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4038\">understated and powerful</strong>, making it irresistible to those who appreciate modern design with soul. From the moment you see it, youÔÇÖll want it ÔÇö and once you try it, youÔÇÖll wonder how you lived without it.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4292\">ItÔÇÖs not just furniture ÔÇö itÔÇÖs your <strong data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4292\">new favorite corner of the house.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"4294\" data-end=\"4297\" />\r\n\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4323\">­ƒîƒ <strong data-start=\"4307\" data-end=\"4323\">Perfect For:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4507\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4354\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4354\">Modern apartment balconies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4387\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4357\" data-end=\"4387\">Contemporary rooftop lounges</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4419\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4390\" data-end=\"4419\">Cozy backyard reading nooks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4420\" data-end=\"4454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4422\" data-end=\"4454\">Hotel patios or Airbnb gardens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4507\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4507\">Family terraces that balance design + durability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"4509\" data-end=\"4512\" />\r\n\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4544\">­ƒº╝ <strong data-start=\"4522\" data-end=\"4542\">Easy Maintenance</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4843\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4603\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4603\"><strong data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4565\">Aluminum Frame</strong>: Wipe down with mild soap and water</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4665\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4665\"><strong data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4626\">Polyester Straps</strong>: Hose off or clean with a soft cloth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4755\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4755\"><strong data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4690\">Teak Wood Armrests</strong>: Use teak protector or let it age naturally to a silver finish</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4843\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4843\"><strong data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4779\">Optional Cushions</strong>: Choose fade-resistant fabric (sold separately or custom order)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"4845\" data-end=\"4848\" />\r\n\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4850\" data-end=\"4892\">­ƒÜÜ <strong data-start=\"4858\" data-end=\"4892\">Ready to Transform Your Space?</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4893\" data-end=\"5176\">If youÔÇÖve been looking for that one set that <strong data-start=\"4938\" data-end=\"4993\">blends clean modern lines with soft natural touches</strong>, the MOMA Living Sofa Set is it. Designed for those who live outdoors, entertain freely, and appreciate good design, this is a smart choice that pays off every time you step outside.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"5178\" data-end=\"5181\" />\r\n\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5183\" data-end=\"5215\">­ƒöÑ Limited Stock Available</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5216\" data-end=\"5364\">The <strong data-start=\"5220\" data-end=\"5244\">MOMA Living Sofa Set</strong> is in high demand ÔÇö and for good reason. Order now to avoid delays and give your outdoor space the upgrade it deserves.</p>','Elegant &amp; Irresistible MOMA Living Sofa Set ÔÇô 5-Piece Outdoor Luxury for Sophisticated Spaces','Shop the stylish MOMA Living Sofa Set ÔÇô a 5-piece carbon-finished lounge with teak wood and dark grey straps. Perfect for mobile-first shoppers craving modern outdoor luxury. Comfortable, durable, and ideal for relaxed entertaining. Buy now before it sells out!','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/moma-living-sofa-set/','products/18928-moma-living-set.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:06:33','2026-07-14 09:42:13'),(2,8011,100,7,13,NULL,'Horizon Coffee Table','horizon-rectangle-coffee-table',NULL,1699.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h4>Horizon Coffee Table ÔÇô Sophisticated Outdoor Furniture for Modern Living</h4>\r\nEnjoy you outdoor area as a place of not only relaxation but a space with style and pizzazz as outdoor furniture. The Horizon Collection exudes a modern sophistication in design that will refine any outdoor seating, dining or lounging area. Produced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=sky-line-design\">SKYLINE Design</a>.\r\n\r\nA combination of Carbon finished Aluminium, dark grey straps and Teak wood armrests combine to create this very contemporary collection perfect for that urban space. Amazing comfortable furniture, designed to enjoy your outdoor space, entertaining friends, or just sit back, open a book, and relax in comfort.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Weaving: Dark Grey Straps 35cm (Polyester)</li>\r\n 	<li>Coating: Aluminium Carbon Matte</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis collection is composed of wide bands of strong and durable woven fibers in a dark gray weave over an aluminum frame along with teak arms which creates a lightweight yet sturdy and profound feature to all the pieces in this collection.\r\n\r\nÔØô Common Questions\r\n\r\nQ1: Is the Horizon Coffee Table resistant from weather?\r\nYes, its aluminium is carbon matte and woven straps are create resistant from UAE sun, humidity and rain.\r\n\r\nQ2: Can it be paired with Horizon seating?\r\nAbsolutely ÔÇô it complements the Horizon Armchair, Side Table, and Lounger for a complete look.\r\n\r\nQ3: Is it easy to move and carry?\r\nYes, the frame is aluminium so it is very lightweight for long-term use.','Horizon Coffee Table ÔÇô 5 Stunning Reasons This Outdoor Furniture is Perfect for UAE Homes','The Horizon Coffee Table combines carbon-finished aluminium, teak details, and dark grey straps for elegance and strength. A premium outdoor furniture piece for UAE patios, terraces &amp; lounges.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/horizon-rectangle-coffee-table/','products/8012-horizon-rect-coffee-table-carbon-matte-top-acp-metallic-black.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:06:33','2026-07-14 09:42:13'),(3,8019,100,8,13,NULL,'Horizon Side Table','horizon-side-table',NULL,1099.00,NULL,0,NULL,'Horizon Armchair ÔÇô Sophisticated Outdoor Furniture for Modern Living\r\n\r\nEnjoy you outdoor area as a place of not only relaxation but a space with style and pizzazz. The Horizon Collection exudes a modern sophistication in design that will refine any outdoor seating, dining or lounging area.\r\n\r\nA combination of Carbon finished Aluminium, dark grey straps and Teak wood armrests combine to create this very contemporary collection perfect for that urban space. Amazing comfortable furniture, designed to enjoy your outdoor space, entertaining friends, or just sit back, open a book, and relax in comfort.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Weaving: Dark Grey Straps 35cm (Polyester)</li>\r\n 	<li>Coating: Aluminium Carbon Matte</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis collection is composed of wide bands of strong and durable woven fibers in a dark gray weave over an aluminum frame along with teak arms which creates a lightweight yet sturdy and profound feature to all the pieces in this collection.\r\n\r\nÔØô Common Questions\r\n\r\nQ1: Is the Horizon Side Table weatherproof?\r\nYes ÔÇô its aluminium carbon matte frame and teak details are resistant to sun, rain, and humidity.\r\n\r\nQ2: Can it be possible to fit with other Horizon furniture?\r\nYes, it can be fit with the like Horizon Armchair, loungers and dining pieces.\r\n\r\nQ3: Is it heavy to move around?\r\nNo ÔÇô the lightweight aluminium frame makes it easy to reposition as needed.','Horizon Side Table ÔÇô Durable &amp; Stylish Outdoor Furniture with Teak &amp; Aluminium','Upgrade your patio with the Horizon Side Table ÔÇô modern outdoor furniture featuring carbon aluminium, grey straps &amp; teak armrests. Stylish, durable &amp; made for comfort.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/horizon-side-table/','products/8023-horizon-side-table-side-carbon-matte-top-acp-metallic-black.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:06:33','2026-07-14 09:42:13'),(4,8537,100,4,13,NULL,'Moma & Tuscany Dining Set in Black','moma-tuscany-dining-set',NULL,15495.00,NULL,8,NULL,'<h4>MOMA Tuscany Dining Set ÔÇô The Ultimate in Outdoor Dining Elegance</h4>\r\nThat will be include <a href=\"https://skyline-design.eu/collections/moma/dining-table-23518-22/\">MOMA Tuscany Dining Set</a> and 7 piece of advantages. So, that can be created the outdoor dining space of your imagination and then that can give it to you relaxing, luxurious and comfortable into in one shot. Created by the most people know and international brand by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=sky-line-design\">Skyline</a> Design. Also this dining set is good for garden dining areas and resting place of pool areas into refined social spaces.\r\n\r\nThis elegant dining set includes:\r\n\r\n1 Tuscany Rectangular Dining Table size 200 X 100 cm in black color.\r\n\r\n6 MOMA Armchairs\r\n\r\nThat\'s can give you the very amaze experience because that\'s can be under the sun or candlelit dinners under the moon or starts it can be everything as indoor or outdoor furniture.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Designed to Impress ÔÇô Anywhere, Anytime</li>\r\n 	<li>Crafted for Harsh UAE Weather</li>\r\n 	<li>Comfort Meets Craftsmanship</li>\r\n 	<li>The Tuscany Dining Table ÔÇô Center of Attention</li>\r\n 	<li>Why Choose the MOMA Tuscany Dining Set?</li>\r\n 	<li>7-Piece Convenience ÔÇô Everything you need in one package</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable in Desert Climates ÔÇô Built for the UAEÔÇÖs extreme environment</li>\r\n 	<li>Not much heavy but strong enough ÔÇô It can be easy to move place to place.</li>\r\n 	<li>Low-Maintenance ÔÇô A simple wipe-down keeps it looking new</li>\r\n 	<li>Matches Entire MOMA Collection ÔÇô Perfect if you want a fully coordinated outdoor space</li>\r\n 	<li>Mobile-First &amp; Ready