data-end=\"1288\" />\r\n\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1338\">2. Evoking the Poise of a French Back Garden</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1816\">The design narrative behind the A600 Low Table hints at a serene moment in a French courtyardÔÇöthe filtered light dancing on wrought-iron furniture, the hush of conversation amid greenery. Pillet captured that feeling in his design: soft curves echoing foliage, generous yet not oversized scale, a quiet confidence that complements rather than competes with nature or interiors. Positioned beside a planter, lounge chair, or sun-drenched step, it resonates with pastoral grace.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1821\" />\r\n\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1885\">3. Engineered for Durability ÔÇö Made from Premium Aluminium</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"2376\">The structural integrity of this table is anchored in robust <strong data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1970\">T6-grade aluminium</strong>ÔÇöa high-strength, corrosion-resistant alloy known for its resilience and lightweight properties. For longevity, the frame undergoes a full powder coat process, using <strong data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2158\">DuPont epoxy paint</strong> cured at high temperature to seal in durability. The result is a table that resists scratching, fading, rust, and weather extremesÔÇöwhile feeling remarkably light when relocated to suit evolving moods or hosting needs.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2381\" />\r\n\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2447\">4. All-Weather Performance ÔÇö Outdoor Ready, Indoor Beautiful</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2534\">This table is engineered to live outside, year-round, but fits as comfortably inside:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2899\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2621\"><strong data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2555\">UV resistance</strong> keeps Charbon and Wh