m Design</strong></h4>\r\nThe smallest solar lamp in <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=maiori\">MAIORI</a>?s range, the PopUp lamp is big on design and technology, and made from laser-cut, shaped aluminium.\r\n\r\nEquipped with a new hybrid MAIORI solar module, the PopUp lamp is also connected, thanks to its Bluetooth system.\r\n\r\nThe MAIORI PopUp lamp is designed to ?pop up? anywhere, at any time ÔÇô on a table, in the garden, or even on a terrace. Extremely compact, it fits easily into a bag to provide light wherever you are. Its eye-opening design and luminosity will not go unnoticed.\r\n\r\nThe design of the lacquered aluminium lampshade was inspired by a Japanese art form ÔÇô Kiri-gami ÔÇô which consists in cutting paper and giving it different shapes, often with moveable joints. It is widely used to make ?Pop Up? cards that create relief patterns when opened. This art form, now very popular in many countries, is still associated with the announcement of a happy event.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Body: Aluminium</li>\r\n 	<li>Finishing: Powdered Coated Paint</li>\r\n 	<li>All-Weather Resistant</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable</li>\r\n 	<li>Sustainable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1910\">ÔØô Common Customer Questions (FAQ)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"2031\"><strong data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1961\">Q1: What materials is La Lampe Lotus made of?</strong><br data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1964\" />It is crafted from aluminium with a durable powder-coated finish.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2174\"><strong data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2079\">Q2: Is it suitable for outdoor use in UAE?</strong><br data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2082\" />Yes, itÔÇÖs all-weather resistant and designed for both indoor and outdoor furniture setups.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2274\"><strong data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2203\">Q3: How portable is it?</strong><br data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2206\" />Extremely compact, it fits into a bag so you can take it anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2395\"><strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2312\">Q4: Does it have smart features?</strong><br data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2315\" />Yes, it includes a hybrid solar module and Bluetooth system for connected use.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2545\"><strong data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2430\">Q5: What inspired its design?</strong><br data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2433\" />The lampshade is inspired by <em data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2473\">Kiri-gami</em>, a Japanese paper-cutting art that creates beautiful relief patterns.</p>','Innovative La Lampe Lotus ÔÇô 3-in-1 Compact Solar Outdoor Lamp with Durable Aluminium','Discover La Lampe Lotus ÔÇô the compact solar lamp crafted from aluminium with a powder-coated finish. Durable, sustainable, and all-weather resistant, perfect for UAE gardens, terraces &amp; modern interiors.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/la-lampe-popup/','products/9731-1-8.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:06:43','2026-07-14 09:42:14'),(76,9751,101,54,2,NULL,'Greens Planter by Maiori','greens-planter',NULL,2299.00,NULL,0,NULL,'If you have 0.3 square meters of floor space you have a garden, seriously!\r\n\r\nGreens Maxi gives you 4 levels of chic vertical gardening to express yourself. Designed as a simple drip watering system, it allows water to flow from top to bottom, eliminating water paddles and overwatering, so it ideal for interior spaces, but not only.\r\n\r\nGreens Maxi, with two and half meters of height, can cover your entire wall from top to bottom, and unlike most of the vertical garden systems, it is easy to install. And if you need a rest from it, or need to move, just disassemble it and see that it all fits stacked in the space of just one single pot.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Body: Aluminium</li>\r\n 	<li>Finishing: Powder Coated Paint</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/greens-planter/','products/9777-1-12.