416\"><strong data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1954\">Durability without compromise</strong> is the foundation of the Gabriel ChairÔÇÖs build. Every component, from the frame to the weave, is selected for its strength, resistance to wear, and sustainability. Despite its solid structure, the chair remains incredibly <strong data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2192\">lightweight</strong>, making it easy to move around and reposition depending on your space or needs. This flexibility is especially valuable for hospitality environments, events, or home settings that require seasonal rearrangements or storage.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2838\">Beyond its physical design, the Gabriel Chair stands as a smart investment in quality <strong data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2525\">outdoor furniture</strong>. It combines modern engineering with timeless appeal, promising not only immediate impact in your d├®cor but also <strong data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2658\">long-term value</strong>. The chairÔÇÖs ability to bridge both outdoor and indoor aesthetics makes it a favorite among designers and homeowners who appreciate continuity and cohesion in their living spaces.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"3152\">The chairÔÇÖs <strong data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2869\">neutral tones</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2893\">versatile style</strong> ensure it can blend with a wide variety of outdoor d├®cors ÔÇö from rustic and coastal to contemporary or minimalist. Whether you accessorize it with bold cushions or let its natural beauty shine, the Gabriel Chair offers a platform for personalized expression.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3497\">Sustainability also plays a role in the chairÔÇÖs appeal. By using materials that are long-lasting and resistant to wear, the Gabriel Chair reduces the need for frequent replacements, which contributes to a more environmentally conscious furnishing choice. This not only supports sustainable living but also reduces maintenance effort over time.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3835\">If you\'re looking for a chair that is as stylish as it is dependable, the <strong data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3590\">Gabriel Chair</strong> delivers on all fronts. ItÔÇÖs the ideal solution for <strong data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3664\">outdoor furniture</strong> that doesnÔÇÖt compromise on comfort, aesthetics, or resilience. Choose the Gabriel Chair to elevate your outdoor lifestyle with beauty, durability, and comfort that lasts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3835\">Whether you\'re hosting a cozy evening gathering or simply enjoying a quiet morning outdoors, the Gabriel Chair supports your lifestyle with comfort and class. Its versatile design ensures it complements dining sets, lounge areas, or reading corners with equal poise. Embrace the charm of outdoor furniture that does more than just sit there ÔÇö the Gabriel Chair is a testament to thoughtful craftsmanship, environmental awareness, and timeless elegance. Add this chair to your outdoor space and experience firsthand how premium design meets practical living, day after day, season after season.</p>','Kina Armchair | Durable &amp; Stylish Outdoor Furniture for Patio &amp; Indoor Use','The Kina Armchair blends elegant design with all-weather durability. Ideal outdoor furniture for patios, terraces, and indoor settings.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/kina-armchair/','products/10249-1-21.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:06:45','2026-07-14 09:42:14'),(114,10279,98,NULL,8,NULL,'York Waverly Kids - Kids Jungle Wallpaper','york-waverly-kids-kids-jungle-wallpaper',NULL,170.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"617\"><strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"617\">Create a Warm, Joyful Space for Your Little One</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"874\">Bring personality and comfort to your childÔÇÖs room with the <strong data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"730\">York Waverly Kids ÔÇô Jungle Wallpap