 &amp; Red</li>\r\n 	<li>Historical piece of the TOLIX┬« collection in a mini version.</li>\r\n 	<li>Perfect at any room, kitchen, backyard, garden, terrace or restaurants.</li>\r\n 	<li>Hand made in France.</li>\r\n 	<li>Resists UV.</li>\r\n 	<li>Stackable.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nÔØô Common Questions\r\n\r\nQ1: Is the H30 Stool weather-resistant?\r\nYes ÔÇô itÔÇÖs UV-resistant and durable, perfect for UAEÔÇÖs outdoor climate.\r\n\r\nQ2: Can children use the H30 Stool safely?\r\nYes ÔÇô its low, sturdy build makes it ideal as a childÔÇÖs seat.\r\n\r\nQ3: Is it easy to keep and store?\r\nYes, the stackable stool, creating it space efficient for homes and restaurants.','H30 Stool ÔÇô 5 Irresistible Reasons This Outdoor Furniture Icon is Perfect for UAE Living','The H30 Stool by Tolix┬« is a mini version of the legendary H stool. Handmade in France, UV-resistant, stackable, and durable outdoor furniture for UAE homes &amp; caf├®s.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/h30-stool/','products/10511-1-22.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:06:48','2026-07-14 09:42:14'),(149,10524,99,45,12,NULL,'A Chair - Perforated Steel','a-chair-perforated-steel',NULL,1899.00,570.00,0,NULL,'<h1 data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"419\">A Chair ÔÇô Perforated Steel by TOLIX┬«</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"479\"><strong data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"479\">A Design Icon Since 1927. Museum-Worthy. Built to Last.</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"991\">Introducing the <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"525\">A Chair Perforated Steel</strong> by <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"539\">TOLIX┬«</strong> ÔÇö a legendary piece of industrial design history that transcends time and trends. Originally created in 1927 by French innovator <strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"688\">Xavier Pauchard</strong>, the A Chair is far more than furniture ÔÇö itÔÇÖs a timeless work of art, a symbol of functional elegance, and a celebrated icon displayed in the worldÔÇÖs top design museums including <str