>.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2694\" />\r\n\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2740\">­ƒøá Effortless Assembly. No Tools Needed.</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2970\">Forget frustrating manuals and missing screws. The Anc├┤ne Table features a <strong data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2864\">proprietary LAFUMA MOBILIER assembly system</strong> that allows you to put the entire table together (or take it apart for winter) <strong data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2969\">without a single tool</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3032\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"3032\">Setup time? Less than 5 minutes.<br data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3009\" />Storage hassle? Zero.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3141\">Whether youÔÇÖre moving, redecorating, or changing seasons, this table works with your rhythmÔÇönot against it.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3146\" />\r\n\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3205\">­ƒî× Engineered for Real Life: Weather, Heat &amp; UV Ready</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3310\">The <strong data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3254\">10mm-thick HPL (High Pressure Laminate)</strong> tabletop is designed to withstand <strong data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3309\">lifeÔÇÖs surprises</strong>:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3585\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3382\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3382\">Ô£à <strong data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3346\">Heat resistant up to 180┬░C</strong> ÔÇô no more worrying about hot pots</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3444\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3444\">Ô£à <strong data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3403\">UV resistant</strong> ÔÇô will not fade or crack under the sun</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3528\">Ô£à <strong data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3482\">Abrasion and im