e installation\r\n\r\nEasy Click Installation: Installs over various surfaces, including tile with grout lines\r\n\r\nTool-Free Setup: No need for heavy-duty tools ÔÇö score and snap with a knife\r\n\r\nCountry of Origin: Made in Germany\r\n\r\nFALCON OAK ÔÇô Where cutting-edge innovation meets timeless style.\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Produced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=teksol\">TEKSOL</a>.</p>\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">The price shown is per Sqm for supply only.</span>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\">Installation charges are 25 AED/Sqm.</span>\r\n<p aria-hidden=\"true\"></p>','7 Revolutionary Falcon Oak Waterproof Flooring UAE ÔÇô Durable Waterproof Floor Mats &amp; Non-Slip Waterproof Mats','Shop Falcon Oak, Waterproof Floor Mats, Waterproof Mats UAE, Non-Slip Waterproof Mats, Durable Waterproof Mats, Waterproof Indoor Outdoor Mats. Premium German flooring for Dubai, Sharjah &amp; Abu Dhabi.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/falcon-oak/','products/16039-falcon-oak-packshot.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:13','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(393,16225,99,20,1,NULL,'Antibes Carpet Roll','antibes-carpet-rolls-2',NULL,299.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h2 class=\"p1\">Antibes Carpet Roll delivers luxurious softness with faux silk pile, 14 mm thickness and elegant abstract look for premium modern UAE interiors.</h2>\r\nA gorgeous carpet with beautiful color adorn your interior to imbue elegance to your room and make it looks more attractive, the abstract and high-quality materials which will add a spark to your room giving you the luxury you desire experiencing a super-soft and a warm welcome every time you step on this carpet.\r\n<h1><b>Ô£à COMMON CUSTOMER QUESTIONS</b></h1>\r\n<h3><b>1. Is this carpet soft?</b></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Yes, the faux silk pile offers an extremely soft and luxurious feel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><b>2. What is the thickness?</b></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Approx <span class=\"s2\"><b>14 mm</b></span>, giving a rich and cushioned sensation underfoot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><b>3. Can I use it on stairs?</b></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Yes, it is rated as stair suitable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><b>4. How should I maintain it?</b></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Vacuum regularly and avoid direct sunlight.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><b>5. Is installation included?</b></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Installation is not included in the price.</p>\r\nAvoid exposure direct sunlight\r\n\r\nTo maintain your carpets appearance it is recommended that it is vacuumed\r\n\r\nIt should be noted that overtime foot traffic will flatten the pile in main walkways causing areas of differential wear\r\n\r\nConstruction : Tufted 1/10 CUT PILE\r\nStatic Electricity Charge : Anti static\r\nPile Material : Faux Silk\r\nSecondary Backing : Luxury Backing\r\nPile weight : ca.1.85 kg/sq mtr +/-7.5%\r\nTotal weight : ca.2.60 kg/sq mtr +/-7.5%\r\nCarpet Thickness : ca. 14 mm +/- 7.5%\r\nStatic electricity charge : Anti static\r\nStair suitability : Yes\r\nMade in Netherlands\r\n\r\nPrice is per m┬▓\r\nInstallation is not included in the price.\r\n\r\nNote: 4 colors also available in 5 Meter width # 150105, 150305, 150112 and 150302\r\n\r\nColor:\r\nBlack Pitch 150325\r\nWhite 150101\r\nSilver 150300\r\nSuolk Stone 150305\r\nMoles Paw 150302\r\nMarsala 150236\r\nOchre 150204\r\nChalk 150108\r\nNavy Blue 150425\r\nPatrol 150412\r\nLondon 150120\r\nRust 150248\r\nCharlston 150112\r\nElephant 150105\r\n\r\nProduced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=teksol\">TEKSOL</a>.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Price mentioned is per Sqm for supply only.</li>\r\n 	<li>The installation charges are 20 AED/Sqm.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"></p>','Antibes Carpet Roll ÔÇô Premium Luxurious Flooring (Top 12 Stunning Benefits)','Antibes Carpet Roll delivers luxurious softness with faux silk pile, 14 mm thickness and elegant abstract look for premium modern UAE interiors.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/antibes-carpet-rolls-2/','products/16218-antibes-ms-2-min.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:13','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(394,16301,99,24,18,NULL,'Nordic Oak Grey SPC','nordic-oak-grey-spc',NULL,105.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h3 class=\"p1\"><b>7 Stunning Nordic Oak Grey SPC Waterproof Flooring UAE ÔÇô Durable Waterproof Floor Mats &amp; Non-Slip Waterproof Mats</b><b></b></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"706\">Bring the serene charm of Nordic design into your living space with the <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"285\">Nordic Oak Grey SPC flooring</strong> ÔÇö a perfect blend of timeless elegance, practicality, and durability. Designed to create a clean and contemporary look, this flooring features a natural oak wood grain in a sophisticated grey hue, making it an excellent foundation for modern interiors. Whether you\'re upgrading a bedroom, living room, or a transitional area that leads to your balcony or patio, this flooring enhances your space with style and function.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"1256\"><strong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"741\">SPC (Stone Plastic Composite)</strong> flooring is renowned for its strength, stability, and resistance to moisture. Nordic Oak Grey SPC takes these advantages even further with its embossed natural timber surface and 4-sided micro bevel edge detail. These features add visual depth and a realistic wood texture underfoot ÔÇö so much so that it feels like walking on genuine oak planks. Its matte grey finish beautifully complements light walls, minimalist interiors, and especially areas decorated with natural materials and <strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1248\">outdoor furniture</strong> themes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1782\">One of the most compelling features of this product is its ease of installation. Thanks to the <strong data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1374\">click-lock system</strong>, thereÔÇÖs no need for glue or adhesives ÔÇö perfect for DIYers and professionals alike. This flooring is not only quick to install but also incredibly low maintenance. The surface is finished with a <strong data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1609\">Urethane Ceramic Bead (CB) coating</strong>, which provides superior resistance against scratches, scuffs, and stains. Whether you have pets, children, or frequent guests, Nordic Oak Grey SPC keeps its beauty intact.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"2259\">With a <strong data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1814\">thickness of 4.8 mm</strong>, these planks deliver a comfortable and quiet underfoot experience. The added stability also makes this flooring suitable for high-traffic areas in both residential and commercial settings. Its robust core handles changes in temperature and humidity exceptionally well, making it ideal for use in kitchens, dining areas, and even semi-outdoor spaces like enclosed porches where your <strong data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2219\">outdoor furniture</strong> might blend into your interior design.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2649\">Each carton covers <strong data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2291\">2.18 m┬▓</strong>, allowing you to calculate your space requirements easily and affordably. Whether youÔÇÖre flooring a small studio or a spacious open-plan home, this product adapts to your needs. YouÔÇÖll also appreciate the peace of mind that comes with a <strong data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2561\">15-year residential warranty</strong> and a <strong data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2598\">5-year commercial warranty</strong>, assuring long-term performance and visual appeal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"3019\">In terms of maintenance, Nordic Oak Grey SPC is designed to make life easier. ItÔÇÖs water-resistant, so cleaning up spills or wet footprints is no hassle at all. Regular sweeping or mopping with a damp cloth is all it takes to keep your floors looking fresh. This makes it a great choice for areas adjacent to patios or gardens, where traffic from outdoors is frequent.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3469\">From its premium wood look to its high-performance composition, <strong data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3108\">Nordic Oak Grey SPC</strong> is more than just flooring ÔÇö itÔÇÖs a design choice that uplifts your space. When paired with rustic or modern <strong data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3239\">outdoor furniture</strong>, this flooring creates a cohesive visual flow from indoor to outdoor, enhancing both comfort and style. The natural grey tone serves as a versatile backdrop for any color palette, whether you prefer neutral tones or bold accents.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3801\">Whether youÔÇÖre renovating a home, fitting out a new property, or simply refreshing your interiors, <strong data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3602\">Nordic Oak Grey SPC flooring</strong> offers the ideal combination of beauty, durability, and practicality. Its modern design, easy installation, and moisture resistance make it a flooring solution you can count on ÔÇö indoors and beyond.</p>\r\nNordic Oak planks can be used in any room in your home such as Kitchens, Dining Rooms, Bedrooms and Basements\r\nVery easy to clean and gives a sparkling look to your room\r\nNo messy glue or adhesives needed.\r\n\r\nEmbossing(s) Natural Timber\r\nThickness: 4.80 mm\r\n2.18m2/carton\r\n5 years commercial and 15 years residential warranty\r\n4-sides Micro Bevel edge detail\r\nUrethane with ceramic Bead (CB) finish\r\n\r\nProduced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=aspecta\">ASPECTA</a>.\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">The price shown is per Sqm for supply only.</span>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\">Installation charges are 25 AED/Sqm.</span>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"></p>','7 Stunning Nordic Oak Grey SPC Waterproof Flooring UAE ÔÇô Durable Waterproof Floor Mats &amp; Non-Slip Waterproof Mats','Shop Nordic Oak Grey SPC, Waterproof Floor Mats, Waterproof Mats UAE, Non-Slip Waterproof Mats, Durable Waterproof Mats, Waterproof Indoor Outdoor Mats. P