59\" data-end=\"2682\">15-year residential</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2717\">5-year commercial warranty</strong>, you can count on this product for long-lasting performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"3101\">Maintenance is quick and easy. A regular sweep and the occasional damp mop are all you need to keep the floor looking clean and elegant. Because of its <strong data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2955\">moisture resistance</strong>, itÔÇÖs also ideal for spaces that frequently experience spills or water exposure ÔÇö such as laundry rooms or mudrooms that connect to the outdoors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3594\">Nordic Oak Light SPC also contributes to a clean, healthy indoor environment. It\'s phthalate-free, safe for families, and doesnÔÇÖt trap allergens or dust. Its durable core makes it suitable for high-traffic areas, while its elegant design uplifts the entire look of your home. The light oak tone pairs effortlessly with both neutral and bold color palettes and complements all styles of <strong data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3510\">outdoor furniture</strong>, whether youÔÇÖre styling a patio-adjacent sunroom or creating a breezy indoor oasis.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3876\">If you\'re looking for a floor that combines aesthetics, comfort, and function ÔÇö <strong data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3700\">Nordic Oak Light SPC</strong> is your ideal solution. Its modern look, robust design, and easy maintenance make it a go-to choice for homeowners, designers, and renovators who value style and practicality.</p>\r\nThese colored planks are perfect for any environment looking for a fresh contemporary look with wooden finish for a unique style and in no time your room will be magically transformed!\r\n\r\nNordic Oak planks can be used in any room in your home such as Kitchens, Dining Rooms, Bedrooms and Basements\r\nVery easy to clean and gives a sparkling look to your room\r\nNo messy glue or adhesi