allation process</strong>. Thanks to the built-in <strong data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2282\">click-lock system</strong>, you wonÔÇÖt need glue, nails, or complicated tools. Whether you\'re a professional installer or a first-time DIY enthusiast, youÔÇÖll appreciate the quick and mess-free setup. Simply lay the planks over any flat, stable subfloor, and click them into place.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2872\">In addition to its practical benefits, this flooring is also easy to maintain. Its protective surface layer repels dust, dirt, and moisture, making daily cleaning as simple as sweeping, vacuuming, or mopping with a damp cloth. ThereÔÇÖs no need for harsh chemicals or intensive upkeep routines ÔÇö just simple care for long-lasting beauty.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"3144\">Each carton covers <strong data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2904\">2.18 m┬▓</strong>, and with its long <strong data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2947\">15-year residential</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2982\">5-year commercial warranty</strong>, Nordic Oak Silver SPC ensures peace of mind for years to come. ItÔÇÖs a flooring solution built not just for todayÔÇÖs living but for tomorrowÔÇÖs challenges as well.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3149\" />\r\n\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3198\"><strong data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3196\">Key Benefits of Nordic Oak Silver SPC</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3668\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3264\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3264\">Authentic silver-toned oak finish with realistic wood texture</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3329\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3329\">Waterproof core ideal for kitchens, bathrooms, and basements</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3386\">Natural Timber embossing for realistic look and feel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li