tps://www.messaraliving.com/product/nordic-oak-silver-spc/','products/16352-nordic-oak-ms-min-6.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:14','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(400,16358,99,24,18,NULL,'Nordic Oak Natural SPC','nordic-oak-natural-spc',NULL,105.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h3 class=\"p1\"><b>7 Stunning Nordic Oak Natural SPC Waterproof Flooring UAE ÔÇô Durable Waterproof Floor Mats &amp; Non-Slip Waterproof Mats</b><b></b></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"268\"><strong data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"268\">Stylish | Waterproof | Easy-to-Install | Durable</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"784\">Transform your home with the timeless elegance and natural charm of <strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"373\">Nordic Oak Natural SPC flooring</strong>. Carefully designed to replicate the beauty of genuine hardwood, this luxury SPC plank features stunning natural oak hues, authentic grain patterns, and an ultra-realistic timber texture that adds instant warmth and character to any interior space. Whether youÔÇÖre renovating a single room or designing an entire home makeover, this flooring solution offers the perfect blend of style, strength, and simplicity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"1218\">Crafted with precision, the <strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"852\">Stone Plastic Composite (SPC) core</strong> provides enhanced structural integrity, making the planks stable, long-lasting, and highly resistant to moisture, scratches, and daily wear. Thanks to this innovative core, you can install Nordic Oak Natural SPC in almost any room, including high-moisture areas like kitchens, bathrooms, laundry rooms, and basements ÔÇö without fear of swelling, warping, or peeling.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1689\">The surface of each plank is embossed with a <strong data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1290\">Natural Timber finish</strong>, delivering the realistic look and feel of woodgrain underfoot. The <strong data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1382\">micro-beveled edges</strong> on all four sides help to further highlight each board individually, giving the appearance of traditional wood flooring while offering all the modern benefits of engineered materials. ItÔÇÖs the perfect choice for those who desire natural wood aesthetics without the maintenance challenges of solid hardwood.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"2057\">Installing this flooring is a breeze, even for first-time DIYers. The <strong data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1796\">innovative click-lock mechanism</strong> allows you to simply snap the planks together without glue, nails, or specialized tools. Whether you\'re covering a small studio or a full living space, the quick and clean installation process reduces downtime and mess ÔÇö so you can enjoy your new floor faster.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2471\">Each plank features a <strong data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2144\">urethane coating enhanced with ceramic bead (CB) technology</strong>, forming a protective wear layer that shields against scuffs, stains, and scratches. This makes it a practical and pet-friendly solution for busy households and commercial spaces. Plus, with just minimal care ÔÇö sweeping, vacuuming, and occasional damp mopping ÔÇö your floor will maintain its shine and appeal for years to come.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2814\">With a <strong data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2510\">total thickness of 4.80 mm</strong>, these planks are comfortable underfoot while offering excellent support and durability. TheyÔÇÖre designed to provide quiet, cushioned steps, which makes them ideal for high-traffic family homes or work environments. Each carton covers <strong data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2757\">2.18 m┬▓</strong>, making it easy to calculate coverage for any room size.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"3165\">Whether you\'re going for a <strong data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2870\">Scandinavian minimalism</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2889\">modern rustic</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2910\">industrial chic</strong>, or even a <strong data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2950\">cozy farmhouse aesthetic</strong>, the soft oak tones of this SPC floor blend seamlessly into any d├®cor. Add indoor plants, neutral furniture tones, or even <strong data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3104\">outdoor-inspired furniture</strong> to create a cohesive flow between indoor and outdoor spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3209\"><strong data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3209\">Why Choose Nordic Oak Natural SPC?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3839\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3309\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3309\"><strong data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3230\">Natural beauty</strong>: Authentic oak color and grain details for a premium wooden floor appearance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3396\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3396\"><strong data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3338\">Versatile installation</strong>: Suitable for all rooms, including moisture-prone areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3487\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3487\"><strong data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3425\">Effortless maintenance</strong>: Easy-to-clean surface with high resistance to daily messes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3574\"><strong data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3507\">Built to last</strong>: Engineered SPC core provides stability and long-term durability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3670\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3670\"><strong data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3594\">Eco-conscious</strong>: Safe, formaldehyde-free materials make it suitable for families and pets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3671\" data-end=\"3746\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3746\"><strong data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3689\">Click system</strong>: Fast, tool-free installation with minimal preparation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3839\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3839\"><strong data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3775\">Stylish yet functional</strong>: Ideal foundation for elegant interiors or cozy home settings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3873\"><strong data-start=\"3845\" data-end=\"3871\">Product Specifications</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"4307\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3907\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3876\" data-end=\"3907\"><strong data-start=\"3876\" data-end=\"3889\">Embossing</strong>: Natural Timber</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3908\" data-end=\"3940\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3940\"><strong data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3929\">Total Thickness</strong>: 4.80 mm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3941\" data-end=\"3987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"3987\"><strong data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"3964\">Plank Edge Detail</strong>: 4-sided Micro Bevel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4043\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3990\" data-end=\"4043\"><strong data-start=\"3990\" data-end=\"4000\">Finish</strong>: Urethane with Ceramic Bead (CB) Coating</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4044\" data-end=\"4080\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4080\"><strong data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4058\">Coverage</strong>: 2.18 m┬▓ per carton</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4081\" data-end=\"4140\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4140\"><strong data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4095\">Warranty</strong>: 15 Years Residential / 5 Years Commercial</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4171\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4171\"><strong data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4163\">Water Resistance</strong>: 100%</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4220\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4220\"><strong data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4195\">Installation Type</strong>: Click-Lock (Floating)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4307\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4307\"><strong data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4242\">Recommended Use</strong>: Bedrooms, Kitchens, Dining Rooms, Bathrooms, Basements, Offices</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4429\" />\r\n\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4477\"><strong data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4475\">Make the Smart, Stylish Choice Today</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4478\" data-end=\"4823\">When it comes to flooring that balances beauty, performance, and practicality, <strong data-start=\"4557\" data-end=\"4583\">Nordic Oak Natural SPC</strong> ticks every box. ItÔÇÖs more than just a surface ÔÇö itÔÇÖs a foundation for your lifeÔÇÖs best moments. Choose a floor that not only looks exceptional but also works harder to give you comfort, durability, and peace of mind every step of the way.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Produced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=aspecta\">ASPECTA</a>.</p>\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">The price shown is per Sqm for supply only.</span>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\">Installation charges are 25 AED/Sqm.</span>\r\n<p aria-hidden=\"true\"></p>','7 Stunning Nordic Oak Natural SPC Waterproof Flooring UAE ÔÇô Durable Waterproof Floor Mats &amp; Non-Slip Waterproof Mats','Shop Nordic Oak Natural SPC, Waterproof Floor Mats, Waterproof Mats UAE, Non-Slip Waterproof Mats, Durable Waterproof Mats, Waterproof Indoor Outdoor Mats. Ideal for Dubai, Sharjah &amp; Abu Dhabi homes.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/nordic-oak-natural-spc/','products/16352-nordic-oak-ms-min-6.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:14','2026-07-14 09:42:15');
