s wherever you put itÔÇöretail, restaurants and hospitality.\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>FAQs</b></span></h3>\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Is Versailles LVT flooring waterproof?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Yes, Versailles LVT flooring is fully waterproof, making it suitable for kitchens, hospitality spaces, retail stores, and residential interiors in the UAE.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Is Versailles flooring suitable for commercial use?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Yes, Versailles waterproof vinyl flooring is designed for high-traffic commercial environments including retail, restaurants, and hospitality spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>What makes Versailles LVT flooring unique?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Versailles flooring features a stylish pre-assembled chevron plank design that creates a premium European-inspired interior appearance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Is Versailles flooring easy to maintain?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Yes, the Duraspect finish helps resist dirt and allows easy everyday cleaning with minimal maintenance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>What is the thickness of Versailles flooring?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Versailles LVT flooring comes with an 8.0 mm thickness for enhanced durability and comfort underfoot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Can Versailles flooring be used in residential interiors?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Yes, Versailles luxury vinyl flooring is suitable for both residential homes and commercial interiors across Dubai and the UAE.</p>\r\nCommercial use\r\nIn-Register Embossing\r\nLimited Commercial Warranty Material 20 years\r\nDuraspect finish\r\n4 Pieces/carton (18.49 Sq.ft. / 1.72 Sq.m.)\r\nThickness 8.0mm\r\n\r\nPrice is per m┬▓.\r\nInstallation is not included in the price.\r\n\r\nColors\r\nAlpin 6816701X\r\nBonheur 6816733X\r\nRiviere 6816731X\r\nBle 6816724X\r\n\r\nProduced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filt