\'s can give it to you unforgettable relaxation, comfortable and legendary style.\r\n\r\nQ: What materials are used in the Gladiator Daybed?\r\nPowder-coated aluminum frame, 15mm Kubu Mushroom synthetic rope, and Quick Dry Foam cushions.\r\n\r\nQ: Can it be match with UAE strong weather?\r\nYes, it can be resistant from UV, good air flow, heat, sand and wet.\r\n\r\nQ: How many cushions included with that?\r\nThat\'s include 18total. That\'s are 12 large and 6 small scatter cushions and that\'s can be decoration and comfortable.\r\n\r\nQ: Can that be used is for like business or organization?\r\nYes, that\'s good for hotels, resting places of the garden, resting places of the rooftop and resting place of the pool of every corner.\r\n\r\nThe price including all the cushions and the coffee table.','Iconic Gladiator Daybed ÔÇô 2-Piece Outdoor Luxury with 18 Cushions','Own the iconic Gladiator Daybed ÔÇô with 18 scatter cushions &amp; a matching coffee table. Crafted to endure, styled to impress. Outdoor luxury redefined.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/gladiator-daybed/','products/23580-1.jpg',0,'2026-07-14 09:07:38','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(508,19030,104,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Natura Wall Shelf','natura-wall-shelf',NULL,2179.00,NULL,0,NULL,'If you are looking for a shelf that\'s modern and eye-catching, you\'re sure to love this NATURA shelf. The three black inserts add character, elegantly wrapping round the premium quality wood to accentuate it.\r\n\r\nThe contrast between the clearly robust appearance and the refined finishes is truly striking. It will add a decorative feel to your living room or hallway. You can combine several of our shelves together to personalize your room for a very distinctive look.\r\n\r\nIt comes in 2 pieces, you can adjust the way you like.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Made in France.</li>\r\n 	<li>10 Years warranty.</li>\r\n 	<li>Self-assemble.</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable &amp; sustainable.</li>\r\n 	<li>Incase of any defect the item will be r