 Netherlands | Per m┬▓','Add elegance to your space withDiamond Carpet Roll\n. Premium flooring made in Netherlands. Sold per m┬▓. Installation not included in the price.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/diamond/','products/19218-00-1.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:39','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(512,19233,99,20,1,NULL,'Dorothy Carpet Roll','dorothy-carpet-rolls',NULL,184.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h3 class=\"p1\"><b>5 Stunning Reasons Dorothy Carpet Roll Redefines Premium Flooring</b><b></b></h3>\r\nA stunning array of colors gives a designer look which feels and makes a statement in any room, it makes your carpet unique with love and care, creating a relaxed welcoming look for your living space by adorning the floor with this adorable carpet.\r\n\r\nThis carpet is a sophisticated choice of soft furnishing for elegant and minimalist home decors\r\nAdd this carpet to any room for a beautiful and natural look\r\n<h2><b>­ƒö╣ Common Questions (FAQ)</b></h2>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><b>Q1: Is Dorothy Carpet Roll suitable for high-traffic homes?</b><b></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Yes, itÔÇÖs rated for heavy domestic use (Class 23).</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><b>Q2: Can it be used in offices or boutiques?</b><b></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Yes, itÔÇÖs suitable for general commercial use (Class 32).</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><b>Q3: Does the wool blend improve comfort?</b><b></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Yes, the wool blend adds natural softness and insulation.</p>\r\nType of Manufacture : Woven\r\nQuality description : Loop Pile\r\nPile Material : 10% Wool / 90% PP\r\nQuality Description : Loop Pile\r\nSecondary Backing : PP ÔÇô Backing\r\nTotal thickness : 5.8mm\r\nPile weight g/m2: 550\r\nPile height : 1.4 mm\r\nMade in Netherlands\r\n\r\nClassification : EN 1307 23 heavy Domestic use\r\n32 general commercial use\r\n\r\n<strong>MADE IN NETHERLANDS</strong>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">The price shown is per m┬▓ for supply only.</span>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\">Installation charges are 20 AED/m2.</span>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"></p>','5 Stunning Reasons Dorothy Carpet Roll Redefines Premium Flooring','Dorothy Carpet Roll flooring with wool blend loop pile, designer colors, and heavy domestic performance. Made in Netherlands. Ideal for UAE homes.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/dorothy-carpet-rolls/','products/19238-0-2.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:39','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(513,19255,99,23,1,NULL,'GTI Max Interlock Tiles','gti-max',NULL,347.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h2 class=\"p1\">GTI Max Interlock Tiles Dubai UAE | Vinyl Flooring</h2>\r\nGTI MAX CONNECT is a multi-layered interlocking looselay vinyl tile with polyurethane treatment (PUR+), 6 mm thick with a dovetail joint, abrasion\r\ngroup T. It is manufactured by GERFLOR for TekSol using a continuous and exclusive high pressure process\r\n\r\nThe GTI MAX wear layer is reinforced by specific ablong fillers that offers an outstanding resistance to traffic.\r\n\r\nGTI MAX is reinforced with 2 glass fiber grids on either side of an intermediate pressed homogeneous layer. GTI\'s backing is a 4mm thick black\r\npressed homogeneous sheet, its surface is a colored and reinforced homogeneous sheet 2 mm thick. It is made of 100% recyclable and made with\r\nup to 80% recycled content.\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>FAQ</b></span></h3>\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>What are GTI Max Interlock Tiles used for?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">GTI Max Interlock Tiles are designed for commercial, industrial, and high-traffic flooring applications such as warehouses, offices, airports, and retail spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Are GTI Max Interlock Tiles durable?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Yes, GTI Max tiles feature a reinforced wear layer with PUR+ treatment for excellent resistance against heavy traffic, scratches, and abrasion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Can GTI Max Interlock Tiles be installed without glue?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Yes, the dovetail interlocking system allows easy looselay installation without requiring adhesives.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Are GTI Max Interlock Tiles eco-friendly?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Yes, they are made with up to 80% recycled content and are 100% recyclable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>What is the thickness of GTI Max Interlock Tiles?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">GTI Max Interlock Tiles have a total thickness of 6 mm with a 2 mm wear layer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Are GTI Max tiles suitable for UAE commercial projects?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Yes, GTI Max flooring is ideal for commercial and industrial environments across Dubai, Sharjah, Abu Dhabi, and the UAE.</p>\r\n<strong>DESCRIPTION</strong>\r\nTotal thickness: 6mm\r\nWearlayer thickness: 2mm\r\nWeight: 936.5 g/sq.m\r\nTile size: 63.5 x 63.5 cm\r\n\r\n<strong>MADE IN FRANCE</strong>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">The price is per Sqm for supply only.</p>\r\nInstallation charges are 20 AED/Sqm.\r\n\r\nProudced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=teksol\">TEKSOL</a>.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/product-category/flooring/vinyl-flooring-rolls/\">Explore more about vinyl flooring dubai UAE.</a>','GTI Max Interlock Tiles Dubai UAE | Vinyl Flooring','Shop GTI Max Interlock Tiles in Dubai &amp; UAE. Heavy-duty vinyl flooring with PUR+ protection for commercial and industrial spaces.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/gti-max/','products/19248-000.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:39','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(514,19261,99,22,6,NULL,'Herringbone Laminated Parquet','herringbone',NULL,77.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h2 class=\"h1 color-red\">HERRINGBONE\r\nTHE CLASSIC COMPLETELY NEWLY LAID</h2>\r\n<h2 class=\"h3\">DISCOVER A NEW ELEGANCE IN WALKING, STANDING AND LIVING.</h2>\r\nAvailable in different shades, this highly up-to-date and yet classic-looking popular flooring can be combined with practically any furnishing style. HERRINGBONE lends even the most minimalist ambience a subdued nuance of Art Deco and Art Nouveau. Inevitably, the panels arranged in staggered┬á90┬░ angles recall the golden age of Viennese caf├®s, Italian opera houses and classical theatres without impairing the modernity of the interior. With their rectangular arrangement, the individual panels, which are 665 mm long and 133 mm wide, enliven and enrich the effect of the room with classic restraint.\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>FAQs</b></span></h3>\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Is Herringbone laminate flooring suitable for homes and offices?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Yes, Herringbone laminate flooring is ideal for residential homes, caf├®s, offices, and luxury commercial interiors across Dubai and the UAE.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>What makes Herringbone laminated parquet unique?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Herringbone laminated parquet combines classic European-inspired parquet elegance with modern laminate durability and contemporary interior styling.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Is Herringbone laminate flooring environmentally friendly?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Yes, KRONOTEX laminate flooring is made using wood from sustainably managed forests and contains no harmful plasticisers or DEHP.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Does Herringbone laminate flooring require glue installation?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">No, it is installed as a floating floor without gluing or nailing, making installation cleaner and easier.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>What are the dimensions of the Herringbone laminate panels?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Each Herringbone laminate panel measures 665 mm in length and 133 mm in width for an authentic parquet appearance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Where is Herringbone laminate flooring made?</b></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Herringbone laminate flooring is made in Germany by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=kronotex\">KRONOTEX</a> using high-quality materials and advanced embossing technology.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>KRONOTEX laminate flooring predominantly consists of a renewable raw material: wood from sustainably managed forests.</li>\r\n 	<li>Laminate floors are ideal for childrenÔÇÖs bedrooms, as they donÔÇÖt contain any plasticisers (phthalates). The German consumer magazine ├ûkotest even explicitly recommends them.</li>\r\n 	<li>Because laminate is installed without nailing or gluing (as floating floors), no adhesive residues result.</li>\r\n 	<li>Innovative embossing processes are used to give the surfaces of modern KRONOTEX laminate floors authentic-looking wood grain and stone structures.</li>\r\n 	<li>Laminate flooring doesnÔÇÖt contain any diethylhexyl phthalate (DEHP) and therefore canÔÇÖt cause any changes in hormone levels.</li>\r\n 	<li>At the end of the product lifecycle, laminate flooring can be unproblematically disposed of or burnt as fuel.</li>\r\n 	<li>KRONOTEX uses the scrap resulting from the production of laminate flooring as fuel.</li>\r\n 	<li>KRONOTEX Laminate Flooring</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>MADE IN GERMANY</strong>\r\n\r\nPrice is per m┬▓\r\nInstallation is not included in the price.\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Supply and installation +25 AED/Sqm.</span>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/product-category/flooring/laminate-flooring\">Explore more German Laminate flooring Dubai UAE.</a>','Herringbone Laminate Flooring Dubai UAE | Luxury Parquet','Discover Herringbone laminated parquet flooring in Dubai &amp; UAE with elegant European-inspired design and durable German-quality performance.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/herringbone/','products/19266-0-3.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:39','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(515,19274,99,20,1,NULL,'Luna Carpet Rolls','luna-carpet-rolls',NULL,226.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h3 class=\"p1\"><b>Luxurious 10mm Luna Carpet Rolls ÔÇô Ultra-Soft Premium Flooring</b><b></b></h3>\r\