nd <strong data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3156\">8 Cleo Dining Chairs</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3342\"><strong data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3201\">Q: Is it comfortable for long meals?</strong><br data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3204\" />Ô£à Definitely! The quickÔÇædry foam and Sunproof Olefin fabric ensure comfort and durability throughout long lunches or evening gatherings.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3505\"><strong data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3382\">Q: Will it fit in a smaller space?</strong><br data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3385\" />Ô£à The design is ideal for mediumÔÇætoÔÇælarge spaces but can also work beautifully in a cozy garden or roof terrace setting.</p>','Transform Your Space: KODO X CLEO Dining Set | 9ÔÇæPiece Masterpiece for Chic Outdoors','Experience timeless beauty and modern flair with the KODO X CLEO Dining Set ÔÇö a luxurious 9ÔÇæpiece ensemble for elegant outdoor spaces. Includes 1 Kodo Table &amp; 8 Cleo Chairs. Premium materials, UVÔÇæresistant, and built for the UAE climate. Order now!','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/kodu-cleo-dining-set/','products/20274-0-5.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:47','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(575,20279,100,12,9,NULL,'Kodo Sun Lounger','kodo-sun-lounger',NULL,7299.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h4 data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"364\"><strong data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"362\">Luxury Kodo Sun Lounger ÔÇô Adjustable 6-Position Outdoor Furniture for Pool &amp; Garden</strong></h4>\r\nSit back and relax in the sun on the beautiful Kodo sunlounger. With its striking design and tactile weave, the Kodo sunlounger is a comfortable eye-catcher. Be it near the pool or amidst your garden, the Kodo sunlounger can easily be moved to follow the sun effortlessly. The backrest can be adjusted into 6 positions and is fully reclinable.\r\n\r\nThe sun lounger is sold without the cushion as outdoor furniture. Produced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=vincent-sheppard\">VINCENT SHEP