. How many adjustable and Does it recline fully?\r\nIt can be 5 time adjustable and positions for mazimum comfort.\r\n\r\n4. Can it be fold and take it for travel?\r\nYes, it can be completely folds and flat for storage and portability.\r\n\r\n5. Is it rustproof?\r\nYes ÔÇö the aluminum frame is 100% corrosion-resistant.\r\n<div class=\"w-full\">\r\n<div class=\"attribute-extender-content\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary-100 w-[50]\"><img class=\"m-auto h-auto w-[3.125rem]\" src=\"https://www.lafuma-mobilier.fr/visuels-lafmob/picto-position-l-2023.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" /><img class=\"m-auto h-auto w-[3.125rem]\" src=\"https://www.lafuma-mobilier.fr/visuels-lafmob/picto-alu-l-2023.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" data-wp-editing=\"1\" /><img class=\"m-auto h-auto w-[3.125rem]\" src=\"https://www.lafuma-mobilier.fr/visuels-lafmob/picto-uv-l-2023.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" /><img class=\"m-auto h-auto w-[3.125rem]\" src=\"https://www.lafuma-mobilier.fr/visuels-lafmob/picto-batyline-l-2023.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" /><img class=\"m-auto h-auto w-[3.125rem]\" src=\"https://www.lafuma-mobilier.fr/visuels-lafmob/picto-recyclage-l-2023.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>','Top-Rated Comfort: Alu Cham Batyline Folding Chair ÔÇô 5 Recline Angles for Perfect Relaxation','Discover the Alu Cham Batyline Folding ArmchairÔÇö5-position recliner, ultra-light aluminum frame, and ergonomic design for unbeatable outdoor comfort. Ideal for travel, garden, or terrace.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/alu-cham-batyline/','products/20295-0-7.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:47','2026-07-14 09:42:15'),(577,20301,100,13,10,NULL,'Alu Cham XL Batyline','alu-cham-xl-batyline',NULL,699.00,210.00,4,NULL,'<div class=\"full-text-container block\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"691\"><strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"691\">Alu Cham XL Batyline Folding Armchai