te your space with this versatile and reliable mat.\r\n\r\nProduced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=teksol\">TEKSOL</a>.\r\n\r\nWidth: 1.22m\r\nLength: 12m\r\nThickness: 7mm\r\nRoll Price: 1470 AED\r\n<h2><b>ÔØô Common Questions</b></h2>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><b>1. Is Z Type Mat waterproof?</b><b></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Yes, it is high-performance <span class=\"s2\"><b>waterproof flooring</b></span>, similar to <span class=\"s2\"><b>Waterproof Floor Mats</b></span>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><b>2. Can it be used in wet areas?</b><b></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Yes, ideal for bathrooms, kitchens, and industrial wet zones.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><b>3. Is it anti-slip?</b><b></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Yes, it works like <span class=\"s2\"><b>Non-Slip Waterproof Mats</b></span> for maximum grip.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><b>4. Is it durable?</b><b></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Yes, it functions as <span class=\"s2\"><b>Heavy Duty Mats</b></span>, resistant to chemicals and wear.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><b>5. How to clean it?</b><b></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Simply rinse with water like <span class=\"s2\"><b>Easy Clean Mats</b></span>.</p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe price mentioned is for supply only.\r\n\r\ninstallation charges are 170 AED/lm','7 Powerful Z Type Mat Waterproof Flooring UAE ÔÇô Durable Waterproof Floor Mats &amp; Non-Slip Waterproof Mats','Buy Z Type Mat, Waterproof Floor Mats, Waterproof Mats UAE, Non-Slip Waterproof Mats, Durable Waterproof Mats, Waterproof Indoor Outdoor Mats for wet areas in Dubai, Sharjah &amp; Abu Dhabi.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/z-type-mat/','products/20805-z-type-moodshot.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:49','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(600,20815,100,11,13,NULL,'Anibal Daybed','anibal-daybed',NULL,17599.00,7040.00,3,NULL,'The versatile Anibal daybed functions as a sun lounge or can also be transformed into a private cabana, with sofa fabric draping from its white-washed frame. Manufactured with quality materials such as synthetic fibers, rust-free aluminum, and waterproof upholstery, all designed to withstand the harsh climate. Skyline is renowned for its extreme durability.\r\n\r\nThe ANIBAL outdoor bed from Skyline Design can be used as a sun lounger or transformed into a private cabana thanks to the fabric of the couch that drapes over its faded white frame. ANIBAL is perfect for a poolside or garden setting and is specially designed to withstand the heat.',NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/anibal-daybed/','products/20821-vector-smart-object-1.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:49','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(601,20831,100,11,13,NULL,'Faber Daybed 15mm','faber-daybed',NULL,16570.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<div id=\"fws_65ba0712ded12\" class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" data-midnight=\"\" data-column-margin=\"default\">\r\n<div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12 left\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column has-animation padding-2-percent inherit_tablet inherit_phone triggered-animation animated-in\" data-padding-pos=\"right\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"fade-in-from-bottom\" data-delay=\"0\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<p class=\"vc_custom_heading\">Introducing our exquisite DAYBED COLLECTION by Skyline Design, a testament to our renowned craftsmanship and diverse design expertise. Featuring contributions from various talented designers, these Daybeds are a hallmark of our brand\'s reputation. Embrace the versatility and functionality of our Daybeds, thoughtfully designed in a range of styles to suit diverse tastes and preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"fws_65ba0712df29a\" class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" data-midnight=\"\" data-column-margin=\"default\">\r\n<div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12 left\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column has-animation padding-2-percent inherit_tablet inherit_phone triggered-animation animated-in\" data-padding-pos=\"right\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"fade-in-from-bottom\" data-delay=\"0\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<p class=\"vc_custom_heading\">Luxurious and comfortable, the FABER daybed is part of the Occasionals collection. Its harmonious lines and enveloping backrest, which recall the shape of an egg, make Faber a product capable of standing out for its elegance and exclusivity, exponentially enhancing your project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"vc_custom_heading\">Faber is also equipped with 6 wheels that are invisible to the eye, which allow the entire structure to be rotated as desired. The daybed is made up of a sturdy aluminum frame, then completed by a splendid external weaving in polywood: extremely resistant synthetic wood, provided with waterproof and UV treatment, to defend against atmospheric agents and the sun.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\nDepth: 184 cm.\r\nWidth: 187 cm.\r\nHeight: 202 cm.\r\nFrame: Grey mushroom N-profile 15mm. \r\nFabric: Agora, Panama fossil.',NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/faber-daybed/','products/22581-faber-faybed-1-600x600-1.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:07:49','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(602,20838,99,63,6,NULL,'Laminate Skirting D1407','laminate-skirting-d1407','376-105ME-L3339',50.00,NULL,249,NULL,'Introducing our German-designed laminate skirting, meticulously crafted to complement laminate flooring. Engineered for durability, it resists scratches and dents, enhancing the flooring\'s longevity. Easy to clean and maintain, this skirting is made from high-quality laminate, ensuring a cohesive and harmonious appearance throughout the space.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Made of HDF.</li>\r\n 	<li>High resistant to scratch and dents, Contributing to