terial: 100% pure virgin PVC\r\n\r\nSurface Coating: PU with ceramic bead coating for enhanced durability\r\n\r\nWaterproof: Yes\r\n\r\nWarm Underfoot: Yes\r\n\r\nDurability: Highly resistant to wear, suitable for high-traffic areas\r\n\r\nHygienic: Easy to clean and maintain\r\n\r\nRecyclable: Environmentally friendly composition\r\n\r\nApplications: Suitable for retail, office, hospitality, leisure, and residential use\r\n\r\nSpecifications:\r\n\r\nThickness: [Insert exact mm value here]\r\n\r\nPlank Size: 304 x 605 mm\r\n\r\nPlanks per Box: 10\r\n\r\nWarranty: 25 years for residential use / 10 years for commercial use\r\n\r\nAllure Stone ÔÇô where performance meets sophistication.\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Produced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=allure\">ALLURE</a>.</p>\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">The price shown is per Sqm for supply only.</span>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\">Installation charges are 25 AED/Sqm.</span>\r\n<p aria-hidden=\"true\"></p>','Luxury Allure Stone 1 LVT Flooring Dubai ÔÇô Waterproof Vinyl Flooring UAE','Shop Allure Stone 1 waterproof LVT flooring in Dubai &amp; UAE. Stylish vinyl flooring with durable, easy-maintenance performance for modern interiors.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/allure-stone-1/','products/22469-travertineivory.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:08:07','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(682,22505,99,24,18,NULL,'Rigid Oak','rigid-oak',NULL,135.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h3 class=\"p1\"><b>7 Powerful Rigid Oak Waterproof Flooring UAE ÔÇô Durable Waterproof Floor Mats &amp; Non-Slip Waterproof Mats</b><b></b></h3>\r\nElevate your interiors with the premium Rigid Oak SPC Flooring by Aspecta ÔÇö a perfect fusion of natural beauty, advanced technology, and long-lasting performance. Expertly manufactured in the Netherlands, this high-end SPC (Stone Polymer Composite) flooring captures the authentic look of real wood through a high-resolution printed decorative film, delivering vivid clarity and 