 stain protection; easy maintenance\r\n\r\nIntegrated Underlayment:\r\n\r\nReduces sound transmission\r\n\r\nShock-absorbing\r\n\r\nWarm and comfortable underfoot\r\n\r\nHelps conceal subfloor imperfections\r\n\r\nDurable and Low Maintenance: Ideal for busy homes and commercial environments\r\n\r\nSpecifications:\r\n\r\nPlank Size: 121 cm (L) x 18 cm (W)\r\n\r\nThickness: 0.5 cm\r\n\r\nCoverage per Plank: 0.22 m┬▓\r\n\r\nPlanks per Box: 10\r\n\r\nWarranty: 25 years residential / 10 years commercial\r\n\r\nExperience the timeless elegance of oak with the innovation of SPCÔÇöchoose Rigid Oak by Aspecta for unmatched style, strength, and comfort.\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Produced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=aspecta\">ASPECTA</a>.</p>\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">The price shown is per Sqm for supply only.</span>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"en-US\">Installation charges is 25 AED/Sqm.</span>\r\n<p aria-hidden=\"true\"></p>','7 Powerful Rigid Oak Waterproof Flooring UAE ÔÇô Durable Waterproof Floor Mats &amp; Non-Slip Waterproof Mats','Shop Rigid Oak, Waterproof Floor Mats, Waterproof Mats UAE, Non-Slip Waterproof Mats, Durable Waterproof Mats, Waterproof Indoor Outdoor Mats. Perfect for Dubai, Sharjah &amp; Abu Dhabi homes and offices.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/rigid-oak/',NULL,1,'2026-07-14 09:08:07','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(683,22520,97,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Falcon Oak','product-22520',NULL,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/product-22520/',NULL,0,'2026-07-14 09:08:07','2026-07-14 09:42:13'),(684,22952,101,62,9,NULL,'Tika lantern with steel base','tika-lantern-with-steel-base',NULL,2799.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h4 data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"470\"><strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"177\">Tika Solar Lantern in camel with steel base</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"470\">Illuminate your outdoor spaces with the <strong data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"262\">Vincent Sh