a-end=\"583\">Glides: Adjustable nylon glides for stability on outdoor surfaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"627\">\r\n<p data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"627\">Use: Outdoor / Garden / Patio / Balcony</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"897\"><strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"661\">Natural Teak Characteristics</strong>\r\nAs a natural material, teak wood may show variations in grain, color, and knots. Over time, exposure to sun and weather may cause the teak to age gracefully, enhancing its natural characterÔÇöperfect for outdoor living in GCC conditions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"921\"><strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"921\">Care &amp; Maintenance</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"990\">Daily cleaning: Wipe with a damp cloth using mild soap and water</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1067\">Grease stains: Fade naturally in sunlight or clean with a teak degreaser</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1161\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1161\">Mildew or black spots: Clean with a vinegar and water solution; avoid placing under trees</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1239\">Wine or tough stains: Use a diluted bleach, water, and detergent solution</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1356\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1273\">Ideal for GCC outdoor spaces</strong>, the Anton Side Table combines durability, simplicity, and timeless teak elegance</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1356\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Tip: Best to match it with Frida lounge chair.</p>',NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/anton-side-table/','products/23961-ms-6.j