hy patio furniture so expensive?</b></span></h4>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Premium patio furniture uses high-quality materials like teak wood and powder-coated aluminum designed to survive outdoor weather conditions for years.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span class=\"s1\"><b>Is teak wood good for UAE weather?</b></span></h4>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Yes. Teak wood is highly durable and naturally resistant to moisture, heat, and outdoor climates, making it excellent for UAE outdoor furniture.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span class=\"s1\"><b>Where can this table be used?</b></span></h4>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">The Arioso Dining Table is ideal for patios, balconies, gardens, terraces, rooftops, caf├®s, and luxury outdoor dining spaces.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"759\"><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"759\">Key Features</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"1016\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"805\">\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"805\">Material: Untreated natural teak tabletop</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"867\">\r\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"867\">Frame: Powder-coated aluminum for strength and durability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"898\">\r\n<p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"898\">Shape: Square dining table</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<p data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"952\">Use: Outdoor dining, garden, terrace, and balcony</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1016\">\r\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1016\">Climate suitability: Ideal for UAE &amp; GCC weather conditions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1185\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Combining natural teak elegance with modern aluminum construction, the <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1119\">Arioso Square Dining Table</strong> is a timeless and practical choice for outdoor dining in the GCC</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1185\" data-is-last-node=\"\