=\"1700\" data-end=\"1800\"><strong data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1720\">Regular Cleaning</strong><br data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1723\" />Simply wash with water and a mild detergent to maintain its sleek appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"2091\"><strong data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1821\">Stubborn Stains</strong><br data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1824\" />Remove dust and debris first. Clean using a soft cloth dampened with water and a universal detergent. For tougher stains, apply detergent directly to the affected area, leave for one to two minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Dry with a soft cloth to prevent water marks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2202\"><strong data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2111\">Spills &amp; Marks</strong><br data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2114\" />Rinse spills immediately with clean water and dry promptly to keep the surface spotless.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2326\"><strong data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2222\">Scratch Repair</strong><br data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2225\" />Touch-up bottles are available to easily restore the powder-coated finish in case of minor scratches.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2326\"><strong>Tip:</strong> Best to match it with Loop lounge chair.</p>',NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/lilo-side-table/','products/24010-ms-9.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:08:10','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(726,24041,100,2,5,NULL,'Kettler living set','kettler-living-set',NULL,10495.00,4198.00,0,NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"251\">Kettler Outdoor Living Set ÔÇô German-Made Luxury for GCC Outdoor Spaces</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"739\">The <strong data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"287\">Kettler Outdoor Living Set</strong> is a sophisticated expression of <strong data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"346\">modern outdoor luxury</strong>, combining <strong data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"382\">German craftsmanship</strong> with contemporary design inspired by <stron