re Relaxation','Experience premium comfort with the Lafuma Transabed Batyline, the ideal outdoor lounger for poolside or terrace. Discover its three adjustable positions, UV-resistant Batyline┬« fabric, and compact design ÔÇö a must-have for your UAE garden.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/transabed-batyline/','products/12032-1-7.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:08:11','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(734,24359,99,20,1,NULL,'ColourTuft 100% SDN Carpet Roll','colourtuft-100-sdn-carpet',NULL,263.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<h3 data-section-id=\"fohydw\" data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"465\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"465\">Premium High-Traffic Carpet Roll | ColorTuft | Commercial Hospitality Flooring UAE</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"815\">Enhance your interior spaces with our <strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"538\">premium ColorTuft carpet roll</strong>, specially engineered for <strong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"665\">hotels, commercial projects, public areas, offices, and high-traffic environments across the UAE</strong>. Manufactured using <strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"723\">100% nylon pile fiber composition</strong>, this carpet offers exceptional durability, aesthetic appeal, and long-lasting performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"1059\">Designed with <strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"874\">heat-set, solution-dyed yarn technology</strong>, the carpet ensures superior color retention, stain resistance, and enhanced resilience, making it an ideal flooring solution for <strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1058\">hospitality, corporate, retail, and public spaces</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1199\">With an <strong data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1089\">8 mm pile height</strong>, it delivers both comfort underfoot and excellent wear resistance, suitable for areas with constant footfall.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1reerq7\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1227\"><span role=\"te