79-tablecafepatio-bourgogne-c.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:08:11','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(737,24459,99,17,17,NULL,'Isostone Floor Tiles','isostone-floor-tiles',NULL,210.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"340\">Introducing Isotone Floor Tiles ÔÇö a premium luxury flooring solution engineered with advanced ISOCore┬« Technology for superior durability, comfort, and acoustic performance. Designed for modern residential, commercial, hospitality, and high-traffic interiors across the UAE, Isotone combines elegant aesthetics with exceptional performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"470\">Built with an innovative 6-layer construction, Isotone flooring delivers unmatched strength, stability, and long-lasting beauty:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"860\">ÔÇó Ceramic Bead Overlay for enhanced wear and scratch resistance<br data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"538\" />ÔÇó Clear Vinyl Wear Layer for superior surface protection<br data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"597\" />ÔÇó High-Resolution Decorative Film with realistic luxury finishes<br data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"664\" />ÔÇó Solid Vinyl Backing Layer for structural support<br data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"717\" />ÔÇó Advanced ISOCore┬« Structural Core for maximum stability and durability<br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\" />ÔÇó Integrated IXPE Sound-Mitigating Underlayment for acoustic comfort</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"1085\">Manufactured with a high-performance composition of 2mm LVT + 4mm ISOCore + 2mm IXPE, these luxury vinyl tiles offer an impressive total thickness of 8mm, creating a premium underfoot feel while reducing noise transmission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1279\">Tile Specifications:<br data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1110\" />ÔÇó Size: 40.68 cm x 81.28 cm<br data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1140\" />ÔÇó Thickness: 8 mm<br data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1160\" />ÔÇó Installation: Click System Installation ÔÇô No Glue Required<br data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1223\" />ÔÇó Warranty: 10 Years Commercial &amp; 15 Years Residential</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1541\">Isotone flooring can be installed directly over existing ceramic tiles with grooves, making it an ideal flooring renovation solution for villas, apartments, offices, retail stores, hotels, and commercial spaces in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, and across the UAE.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1805\">With its bold luxury appearance, waterproof performance, sound insulation, and easy installation system, Isotone Floor Tiles are the perfect choice for architects, interior designers, contractors, and homeowners seeking high-end luxury vinyl flooring in the UAE.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1805\">The price showing is per Sqm for supply only.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1805\">The installation charges are┬á 25 AED/Sqm.</p>',NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/isostone-floor-tiles/','products/24472-12.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:08:11','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(738,24493,100,2,14,NULL,'Redford Lounge Set','redford-lounge-set',NULL,2944.00,NULL,0,NULL,'Enjoy the comfort and grace of this outdoor sofa set in your garden or outdoor space. This living set consists of an armchair, a chaise lounge, a two-seater sofa, and a wooden coffee table. Supported by galvanized steel frame, this sofa set designed to ´¼éaunt.\r\nFurthermore, it has comforting, waterproof seats and cushions for a wonderful time amidst nature.\r\n\r\nSet Price Includes:\r\n1 Single Chair\r\n1 Three Seat Bench\r\n1 Chaise Lounge\r\n1 Coffee Table',NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/redford-lounge-set/','products/18834-0-min-2.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:08:11','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(739,24514,100,74,NULL,NULL,'Moma Hanging Dining Set','moma-hanging-dining-set',NULL,39399.00,NULL,0,NULL,'<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"df640ee8-4ef0-4b3f-9f69-4ff89c02cf70\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request