-end=\"1250\">Modern pergola-inspired design</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1x9i3wq\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1318\">Ideal for villas, hotels, resorts, patios, and outdoor terraces</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"bjamq\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1374\">Durable, comfortable, and low-maintenance materials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1602\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Designed for those who appreciate innovative outdoor furniture and contemporary luxury, the Moma Hanging Dining Set brings together comfort, craftsmanship, and architectural elegance in one exceptional outdoor dining solution.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section></div>',NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/moma-hanging-dining-set/','products/24515-moma-hanging-dining-mood-shot.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:08:12','2026-07-14 09:42:13'),(740,24531,100,46,10,NULL,'Transabed Aircomfort','transabed-aircomfort','199-LFM28536135-1',899.00,270.00,6,NULL,'<h4 data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"267\"><strong data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"265\">Transabed Aircomfort ÔÇô 5 Reasons This Premium Deckchair is the Ultimate Outdoor Comfort</strong></h4>\r\nLafuma premium deckchair has a wide seat and is adjustable to three positions, including one completely flat, with loop and snap hook. This practical chairÔÇÖs compact folding make it easy to transport. Combined with its Next foot rest, this duo will bring a dose of additional comfort for the sun lovers on the poolside or terrace. Produced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=lafuma\">LAFUMA</a>.\r\n\r\nRevolutionise relaxation in the garden, on the patio or beside the pool with the Transabed equipped with the Air Comfort┬«seat pad. Treat yourself to total well-being with its generous size, its \"sun bed\" position combined with the unrivalled softness of its cushioning. It\'s a truly relaxing deckchair.\r\n\r\n<b>Its advantages:</b>\r\nThe three positions including one completely reclined which give the product a \"sun bed\" function, perfect for sunbathing or taking a nap.\r\nIngenious and simple to use adjustment system made up of a system of snaphooks integrated into the armrests in an ultra resistant strap.\r\nIts padded Air Comfort┬«seat pad: not just 100 % comfort! made up from a combination of breathable and permeable materials, it does not retain water, it promotes air circulation and dries quickly.\r\nRemovable and adjustable headrest cushion.\r\nSpace-saving when folded.\r\n\r\n1. Is the Transabed Aircomfort good for UAE weather?\r\nYes, the pad is Air Comfort┬« it can be also UV-resistant, good breathable and quick drying and good for strong hot and humudity conditions .\r\n\r\n2. Can it be fully set or laying in this chair?\r\nAbsolutely. One of its 3 positions is fully flat, creating a ÔÇ£sun bedÔÇØ for naps or tanning.\r\n\r\n3. Does it come with a headrest?\r\nYes, it includes a removable and adjustable cushion.\r\n\r\n4. Can it be easy to pack and easy to carry?\r\nYes, you can easly to folds compactly for easy storage and transport.\r\n\r\n5. Can I use it indoors even if outdoor furniture?\r\nYes, it\'s design is stylish and make comfortable and good for indoor relaxation too.','Transabed Aircomfort ÔÇô 5 Powerful Reasons This Luxury Deckchair Is the Ultimate Outdoor Comfort','Experience pure relaxation with the Transabed Aircomfort deckchair ÔÇö extra-wide, 3-position adjustable, water-repellent, and foldable. Perfect for UAE poolside, garden, or patio living.','https://www.messaraliving.com/product/transabed-aircomfort/','products/12047-1-8.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:08:12','2026-07-14 09:42:16'),(741,24532,100,46,10,NULL,'Next Aircomfort','next-aircomfort','199-LFM28506135-1',499.00,150.00,0,NULL,'<h4 data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"558\">­ƒî× <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"556\">Next Aircomfort ÔÇô The Perfect Footrest and Extra Seat for the UAE</strong></h4>\r\nThe Next Aircomfort is your latest partner for relaxation by the every resting place of the pool, every corner of the garden and can put on the terrace. Its design is very flexible and also it can be serves as both a comfortable footrest for your outdoor furniture and an extra soft, it is even saving the space of the seat when needed. Produced by <a href=\"https://www.messaraliving.com/shop/?filter_brand=lafuma\">Lafuma</a>.\r\n\r\nLightweight and foldable, itÔÇÖs ideal for mobile lifestyles in the UAE ÔÇö easy to carry and quick to set up. The fabric can be long term because using Batyline┬« also that\'s can give you the resistance from UV by excellent and the weave is open that\'s can be retain water and resistance to tearing and distortion. Its galvanized steel frame guarantees strength and rust proof for the long term, creating it good for the UAE climate.\r\n\r\nWhy YouÔÇÖll Love the Next Aircomfort\r\n\r\nUltra-comfortable design for lounging and relaxation\r\n\r\nMultipurpose: footrest or compact, soft seat\r\n\r\nStrong galvanized steel frame (rust-free)\r\n\r\nBatyline┬« Iso fabric ÔÇö UV resistant, quick-drying, and long-lasting\r\n\r\nFolds easily for transport and storage\r\n\r\nIts advantages:\r\nIts Batyline┬« Iso fabric is particularly suitable for furniture around swimming pools given its excellent UV resistance and open weave that does not retain water. Batyline┬« canvas is very resistant to tearing, does not distort and is easy to maintain, a little soapy water is all you need.\r\nThe galvanised steel frame is sturdy and rust-free.\r\nCompact size when folded.\r\nBeing lightweight which means it is easily portable.\r\n\r\nCommon Questions Answered\r\n\r\nQ1. Is it good for every corner of the poolside use?\r\nYeap! The fabric is use by Batyline┬« and it is also resistant from UV and can be retain water, creating it good for poolside relaxation.\r\n\r\nQ2. Is it easy to move and carry?\r\nYes! It\'s lightweight but strong enough design and frame is very portable.\r\n\r\nQ3. Can it be possible to used as an extra seat?\r\nDefinitely! The Next Aircomfort doubles as a comfortable, space-saving seat for guests.\r\n\r\nQ4. How do I clean it?\r\nJust wipe down the Batyline┬« fabric with mild soapy water ÔÇö itÔÇÖs low maintenance and long-lasting.',NULL,NULL,'https://www.messaraliving.com/product/next-aircomfort/','products/12047-1-8.jpg',1,'2026-07-14 09:08:12','2026-07-14 09:42:16');
